     We continue in our Rip Van Winkle mode:  Five of our six top=20
positions at yearend 1994 were left untouched during 1995.  The=20
sixth was American Express, in which we increased our ownership to=20
about 10%.

     In early 1996, two major events affected our holdings:  First,=20
