Disney stock.

     In the Disney merger, Cap Cities shareholders had a choice of=20
actions.  If they chose, they could exchange each of their Cap=20
Cities shares for one share of Disney stock plus $65.  Or they=20
could ask for - though not necessarily get - all cash or all stock,=20
